## 4️⃣ Suggested Itinerary

| Time (local) | Activity |
|--------------|----------|
| **10:00 – 10:30** | Pick up your rental at the YVR car‑rental desk (any of the providers above). |
| **10:30 – 11:15** | Drive to Capilano Suspension Bridge (follow signs to “Capilano Suspension Bridge”). |
| **11:15 – 14:30** | Explore the park: walk the bridge, Treetops Adventure, Cliffwalk. Lunch at the on‑site café. |
| **14:30 – 16:30** | Optional: short drive to **Lynn Canyon Park** (≈ 10 min) for a quieter bridge and forest trails. |
| **16:30 – 19:00** | Return toward downtown Vancouver; park near **Gastown** or **Canada Place** for dinner (great seafood & waterfront views). |
| **Evening** | Stroll the waterfront, maybe visit the **Vancouver Lookout** for night‑city panoramas. |
| **Next morning (Nov 8)** | Breakfast, then drive back to YVR. |
| **15:00** | Return the car at the same rental desk (you have a comfortable buffer for traffic & airport security). |

